<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車トンネル.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花覗き込み.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>As you'd expect, my face went stiff.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This meant, in other words, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had put a curse on me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ha, hahaha...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That's right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! The person trying to kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is right there beside you, after all! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　That's the face you've gotta make!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I'd seen <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> with a face like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her bloodshot eyes wide open, she was grinning broadly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had to compare it to something, yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
it was a witch's face.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'re really such an idiot...! You came with me knowing I'm a killer, didn't you? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　You came all this way trusting me, didn't you? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Just how full of daydreams is your head...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Hahahahaha heh hahahaha heh hahaha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Th-that's not true! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't do anything like that!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Heh-hahahahahaha! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　So, what are you gonna do!? </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　On a train like this, there's nowhere to run! </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Natsumi! </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　You're going to die! </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　You're going to die today...!! </STYLE>
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　HAHA-HE-HAHAHAHA-HYA-HAHA...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This isn't <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, turned into a witch...?<PG>
No! Don't let yourself be pushed back!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By now <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is confused too, frantic, and just doesn't know what to do anymore!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I absolutely mustn't <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ひ">back</STYLE> down a single step!<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> isn't going to kill me...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Because... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s been my best friend since we were born...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For an instant, the phrase 'make-believe friendship' rose in my mind.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, I didn't think such a cheap line would work.<PG>
But, I absolutely must not give in here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, still wearing the face of a "witch," kept staring at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I won't lose to something like that.<PG>
But,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
From <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s eyes, swollen from crying, tears came flowing again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車汽笛.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumiii</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't want you to die... Please don't die..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> cried out in a sorrowful voice, tears spilling again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is the best proof there is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> has no intent to kill. All she has is the delusion that she's a witch, and a paper doll.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... calm down."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I reached out to rub <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't touch me!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I have no right to be comforted by you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No! Right now, I absolutely must not accept what <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s claiming.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'm staying with you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. You, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, didn't kill </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">my dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> or anything. And you won't kill me either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... but, this morning, for real―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't take me for a fool. That kind of trickery, I'll sweep it away for you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm a witch! Why are you with me!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"The one who said 'stay with me' was you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, wasn't it!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, that's right! I thought if I sent you somewhere far away, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you'd be okay! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But I realized that if I'm with you, it's no good in the end!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Really, what you're saying is a total mess! I bet your curse too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, is just some messy, sloppy story!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's not sloppy! Everyone I've put a curse on up to now has died!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"As if I'd believe a story like that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Shut up, shut up, shut up!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　What would </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> know about me!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Someone like </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> isn't my friend anymore!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ビンタ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花ビンタされる.gal" "NORMAL" "12" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKESTOP "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n111\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
My open hand struck <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s cheek.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s hair clip came off, and her bangs fell softly over her face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I had ever hit anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hand, from <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s tears, got <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE>, and it hurt more than I'd imagined.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... What was that? What you just said. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Not my friend?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Come on, say it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">"I'm telling you to say it one more time! </STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="8">　Not my friend anymore!?"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's not it...! I didn't mean it for real...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hah, I can't believe you, saying something like that on impulse... </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what do you want? What are you going to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know... I don't know...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then what am I supposed to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"What's with that... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">What's with that! You cry and apologize, you say you don't want me to die, and that's all!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Why won't you say you'll save me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Save you...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"If our places were reversed, no matter what happened, I would absolutely protect you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Or those words, 'not my friend,' did you mean them?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Th-there's no way I did! I... </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Then save me! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, protect me from the curse you put on me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="9">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="9">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="9">I'll save her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I can't hear you. Say it more clearly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'll... save </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> from the shinigami."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hearing those words, I could finally let the strength go out of my shoulders.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, if the shinigami appears, save me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Please, right now the only one I can rely on is you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Thank you. But I still can't believe in your curse, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But, maybe the 'shinigami' that killed six people does exist. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That thing, what's it like?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At my question, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> took one big, deep breath.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The shinigami always kills the one I curse. In a really cruel, horrible way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you know too, right? About the Megasawa City case..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah... I know."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whenever I put a curse on someone, without fail, the Megasawa City case happens on April 8. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Without any exception, when I put a curse on someone, on April 8 the one I cursed always dies..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Don't tell me the culprit of the Megasawa City case is... that shinigami?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right... That's why it can kill in ways no human could... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm a witch and I called up the shinigami, so I know its true identity."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see, by <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s logic, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> is the mastermind and the shinigami is the one who does the killing, then.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had known the shinigami's true identity―in other words, the true identity of a violent criminal―and kept quiet all along.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why hadn't the police been able to pin it down?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Whatever the shinigami is, the one inside is probably human anyway, and the spiriting-away-like methods must be some kind of trick.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> knows about how it's done, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The shinigami's true identity, I'll tell only you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. It'll surely show up in front of you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"The shinigami's true identity is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">my dad."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\電車汽笛.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESOFF "200"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\電車トンネル.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Huh? I couldn't hear well over the horn just now...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I couldn't really hear..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's my dad...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad is the shinigami?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who's supposed to be overseas, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, your dad came all the way back to Japan for this day?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry I kept quiet till now, but my dad passed away a long time ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When I put a curse on someone, he appears on April 8, the anniversary of his death, and my wish―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">he kills the one I cursed, for me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's exactly because he's a dead person that such spiriting-away-like crimes are possible."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s dad had passed away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even a confession that should have been a huge deal was, by now, only one piece of information.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, a dead person being the culprit, I couldn't believe that right away.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Your dad who became the shinigami, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, have you ever met him?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I've never met my dad as the shinigami either, so I don't really know what he looks like... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But... when I lived in Megasawa City, I heard it as a rumor... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Apparently there was someone who witnessed the moment of a crime, just barely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which meant that, at least, they probably hadn't been killed by something invisible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My dad... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11" RUBY="なた">Nata</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and a mace, in other words a metal </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="こんぼう">club</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">: he kills with those, apparently. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And..."</STYLE>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"He wears a Noh mask."</STYLE>
